{"version":1,"content":"<p>現年59歲的謝天華（Laughing）早年憑《學警狙擊》等劇集攀上事業高峰，近年轉戰內地發展，憑《大灣仔的夜》等熱播綜藝節目風生水起，商演及演唱會邀約不斷。</p><p>然而，其外貌狀態一直備受外界關注，早前曾被指面容浮腫憔悴。</p><p>近日，有網民在四川都江堰一</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T09:21:08.232171+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T09:01:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T09:18:05.507426+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T09:18:05.507426+00:00","content_hash":"43a67be0ac5ab6e5e9f5097256476c141925a691b4cfaac5f78a318235b75580","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}